{"3642500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Liv: Nordic Survival", "steam_appid": 3642500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your awakening is the end of everything you thought you knew – and the beginning of something greater than yourself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras/54e68fa4bc5d0fe27577c67926d7169d.avif?t=1769069721\" width=1536 height=729 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You open your eyes. Cold. Wind. Earth. Beneath you: blue cracks stretch across the ground, from which light and energy pulse – as if the world has exposed its innermost secrets. You remember nothing. No name. No origin. No why. Only one thing is clear: You are alone. Naked. And this place... lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger sets in. Thirst scratches at your throat. But is the water drinkable? Nature demands respect – or your life. Adapt to survive in harmony with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival is not an option – it is your only way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras/05305466072421f21cffd67f1837a0ee.avif?t=1769069721\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras_big/05305466072421f21cffd67f1837a0ee.avif?t=1769069721 width=800 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your surroundings and gather what might prove useful. First tools take shape. A spear. An axe. Perhaps enough for a primitive trap. Hunting means food. Food means time. Time to learn. Time to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras/8dee2d947c8c88999b0645078b738429.avif?t=1769069721\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras_big/8dee2d947c8c88999b0645078b738429.avif?t=1769069721 width=800 height=306 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You build your first shelter. Protection – though rudimentary... And as you progress, the island changes. The days grow shorter. The nights grow colder. Snowflakes signal what’s to come: Winter is coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And you will have to be prepared.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras/17f445bc24f50196491245759f9b87e0.avif?t=1769069721\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras_big/17f445bc24f50196491245759f9b87e0.avif?t=1769069721 width=800 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build. Hunt. Gather supplies. Explore the secrets of the blue cracks, which may hold the key to your past – or any answer at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is not just a game of survival. It is a game of truth. Of memory. And of hope in a world that has long forgotten you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an open-world survival game playable in both first- and third-person perspectives.<br>The current version includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large explorable map divided into <strong>4 distinct regions</strong>, each with unique environments and resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core survival mechanics such as <strong>hunting, fishing, crafting, and resource management</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>base building system</strong> that allows players to construct and customize shelters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>skill progression and leveling system</strong> to improve abilities like stamina, crafting efficiency, or strength</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A working inventory system with storage management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic day/night cycle and weather effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player and co-op gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...with more content and polish planned during Early Access development</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your awakening is the end of everything you thought you knew – and the beginning of something greater than yourself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras/54e68fa4bc5d0fe27577c67926d7169d.avif?t=1769069721\" width=1536 height=729 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You open your eyes. Cold. Wind. Earth. Beneath you: blue cracks stretch across the ground, from which light and energy pulse – as if the world has exposed its innermost secrets. You remember nothing. No name. No origin. No why. Only one thing is clear: You are alone. Naked. And this place... lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger sets in. Thirst scratches at your throat. But is the water drinkable? Nature demands respect – or your life. Adapt to survive in harmony with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival is not an option – it is your only way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras/05305466072421f21cffd67f1837a0ee.avif?t=1769069721\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras_big/05305466072421f21cffd67f1837a0ee.avif?t=1769069721 width=800 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your surroundings and gather what might prove useful. First tools take shape. A spear. An axe. Perhaps enough for a primitive trap. Hunting means food. Food means time. Time to learn. Time to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras/8dee2d947c8c88999b0645078b738429.avif?t=1769069721\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras_big/8dee2d947c8c88999b0645078b738429.avif?t=1769069721 width=800 height=306 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You build your first shelter. Protection – though rudimentary... And as you progress, the island changes. The days grow shorter. The nights grow colder. Snowflakes signal what’s to come: Winter is coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And you will have to be prepared.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras/17f445bc24f50196491245759f9b87e0.avif?t=1769069721\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras_big/17f445bc24f50196491245759f9b87e0.avif?t=1769069721 width=800 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build. Hunt. Gather supplies. Explore the secrets of the blue cracks, which may hold the key to your past – or any answer at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is not just a game of survival. It is a game of truth. Of memory. And of hope in a world that has long forgotten you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an open-world survival game playable in both first- and third-person perspectives.<br>The current version includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large explorable map divided into <strong>4 distinct regions</strong>, each with unique environments and resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core survival mechanics such as <strong>hunting, fishing, crafting, and resource management</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>base building system</strong> that allows players to construct and customize shelters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>skill progression and leveling system</strong> to improve abilities like stamina, crafting efficiency, or strength</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A working inventory system with storage management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic day/night cycle and weather effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player and co-op gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...with more content and polish planned during Early Access development</p>", "short_description": "You are LIV. Naked and with no memory, you awaken on a mysterious island. Discover who you are. Hunt, build, craft – survive cold, hunger, and madness. Learn, evolve, and uncover the secret that seems to slumber beneath the surface.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Italian, Portuguese - Brazil, Polish, Russian, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/2282b4aa9df55b01b3d1f2b36fff82baa660843f/header.jpg?t=1769069721", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/5f059f24b967ad27b479a5477f0abae97e7343fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769069721", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/5f059f24b967ad27b479a5477f0abae97e7343fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769069721", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong>  Windows 7/8/10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBA GB RAM MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Ve